# =============================================================================
# The Omar Files — .gitignore
# =============================================================================
# This project is a generic tool built around one specific, private group
# chat. Everything below is either that private data, something derived from
# it (which still leaks real names/content), or purely local machinery/cache.
# None of it should ever leave your machine.
#
# If you're setting this up for your OWN chat, this is exactly the set of
# files/folders the pipeline will (re)create for you locally — you don't
# need any of them from git.
# =============================================================================

# --- The actual chat data ---------------------------------------------------
# Raw monthly WhatsApp exports and their normalized intermediates. Full
# message content, real names, real timestamps.
Raw_Exports/*
!Raw_Exports/.gitkeep
Pipeline/normalized_exports/*
!Pipeline/normalized_exports/.gitkeep

# The name/phone-number directory. This is the single most sensitive file in
# the whole project — it maps real phone numbers to real people. It is NOT
# just "internal IDs to names" the way message content is scrubbed; treat it
# like a contacts list. Copy Pipeline/identities.example.json to
# Pipeline/identities.json to get started with your own.
Pipeline/identities.json

# Run history for the merge step (harmless on its own, but it's local state,
# not something to track).
Pipeline/logs/*
!Pipeline/logs/.gitkeep

# --- Generated reports -------------------------------------------------------
# These are the finished deliverables the pipeline writes to the project
# root every run. They're built from your archive, so they're exactly as
# private as the archive itself.
/Full_Archive.txt
/Full_Archive.pdf
/chat_report.html
/chat_report.pdf
/chat_search_data.json
/arc_report.txt
/arc_timeline.png

# --- Generated analysis data & caches ---------------------------------------
# Cached charts and arc-summary data. These contain real names and per-person
# message stats pulled straight from the archive.
Pipeline/Tools/chat_analyzer/_chart_cache/*
!Pipeline/Tools/chat_analyzer/_chart_cache/.gitkeep
Pipeline/Tools/arc_analyzer/data/*
!Pipeline/Tools/arc_analyzer/data/.gitkeep

# --- Backup / decryption artifacts ------------------------------------------
# In case you're pulling a full history from a phone backup (see
# msgstore_export.py in the docs) — never commit the database or any key
# material used to decrypt it.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
msgstore*
*.key
*.crypt*

# --- Python ------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# --- OS / editor cruft ---------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
